OL,3,GNEWSAWildfire fears over hotel's
OL,4,Awedding fireworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in Surrey have voiced
OL,7,Fconcerns over a hotel's plans to stage
OL,8,Fa fireworks display over the weekend,
OL,9,Fsaying it risks sparking wildfires in
OL,10,Fneighbouring woodland.
OL,12,FPennyhill Park Hotel & Spa in Bagshot
OL,13,Ftold locals it would be holding "a
OL,14,Fprofessionally managed, approximately
OL,15,Ffive minute display" at 22:00 BST on
OL,16,FSaturday as part of a wedding
OL,17,Fcelebration at the venue.
OL,19,FIt stated that a "detailed
OL,20,Fsite-specific risk assessment" had been
OL,21,Fundertaken and "additional
OL,22,Fprecautionary measures introduced".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
