OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWildfire fears over hotel's
OL,4,Awedding fireworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, some fear stray embers could
OL,7,Fcause "massive destruction" to the
OL,8,Fadjacent Swinley Forest, while Surrey
OL,9,FFire and Rescue Service (SFRS) said it
OL,10,F"strongly advised against the use of
OL,11,Ffireworks".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
